  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) of the triangle formed by the lines <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and the tangent at the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> on <math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> is equal to"
