  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of the tangent at point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> on&nbsp;<math><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> is <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.<br />Now, point of intersection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.<br />Point of intersection of <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br />Point of intersection of <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, area of the triangle formed by the points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;sq.units"
  }
